{21}{I'll buy and sell most any standard supplies and equipment. Food, lamps, jewelry, little bits of technology, but not herbs. Would you like to see my stock?}{I'll buy and sell most any standard supplies and equipment. Food, lamps, jewelry, little bits of technology, many different things. Would you like to see my stock?}{}{}{}{}
