{40}{I wanted her to work in the store with me, perhaps take it over when I pass on. It's an honest living and she's a keen mind for a bargain. However, she insisted on learning "medicines", and "technology". Rubbish. She's got it in her head that she wants to be an adventurer! Can you believe it?}{I wanted her to work in the store with me, perhaps take it over when I pass on. It's an honest living and she's a keen mind for a bargain. However, she insisted on learning "medicines", and "technology". Rubbish. She's got it in her head that she wants to be an adventurer! Can you believe it?}{}{}{}{}
