{43}{Wow, amazing. Goodbye.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{44}{Booooring. Bye bye.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}


{50}{I just can't accept that my daughter is meant for that kind of life. I'd do anything to have her safe at home with me again. Say, do you think you might be able to talk to her? Convince her, perhaps? There's coin in it for you.}{I just can't accept that my daughter is meant for that kind of life. I'd do anything to have her safe at home with me again. Say, do you think you might be able to talk to her for me? Convince her, perhaps? There's coin in it for you.}{}{}{}{}
