{60}{I'd appreciate it. Her cabin is across town, just next door the inn. She tends the herb garden there. I'll pay you 50 coin to talk her into coming home.}{I'd appreciate it. Her cabin is across town, just next door the inn. She tends the herb garden there. I'll pay you 50 coin to talk her into coming home.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{I'll get started right away.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
