{110}{[As he listens to you, his face grows sad with realization.] I... I never knew she was so passionate about travelling. Thank you, sir, for helping me to better understand Jana. Please tell her she has my blessing to go where her heart leads.}{[As he listens to you, his face grows sad with realization.] I... I never knew she was so passionate about travelling. Thank you, madam, for helping me to better understand Jana. Please tell her she has my blessing to go where her heart leads.}{}{}{}{}
