{140}{Thank you, traveller. You have returned the joy to an old man's life. Jana will be happier tending the store here, anyway. Here is your 50 coin, and my thanks always be with you.}{Thank you, traveller. You have returned the joy to an old man's life. Jana will be happier tending the store here, anyway. Here is your 50 coin, and my thanks always be with you.}{}{}{}{}
